<title>NETHERLANDS: DE BOER 1996 NET UP SIX PERCENT.</title>
<headline>DE BOER 1996 NET UP SIX PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>ASSEN, Netherlands 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     7.77 vs   7.47</p>
<p>    Net profit			    35.2  vs  33.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  2.85 vs   2.75</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  2.11 vs   1.68</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    49.4  vs  45.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Supermarkets group De Boer Winkelbedrijven NV earlier</p>
<p>said it expected higher profits in 1996. In October it announced</p>
<p>plans to merge with unlisted Unigro NV, which would create a</p>
<p>group with annual sales of more than six billion guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
